# CLI-entrypoints: geen `vsa mvsa`

**Nooit** `vsa mvsa …` — dat bestaat niet.

| Bron        | Commando (console-script)                                      |
| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `.mvsa`     | `mvsa validate` / `mvsa mxl` / `mvsa mscz` / `mvsa pdf` / …    |
| `.mscz`     | `mscz …`                                                       |
| `.mxl`      | `mxl …`                                                        |
| `.vsa`      | `vsa validate` / `vsa svg` / `vsa musicxml` / …                |

Hulptekst (alleen `.mvsa`):

```cmd
mvsa mxl pad\lied.mvsa --hulptekst
mvsa mxl pad\lied.mvsa --hulptekst-as-parts
mvsa mscz pad\lied.mvsa --hulptekst
```

Sibling-uitvoer (default): `lied.mvsa.mxl`, `lied.mvsa.mscz`, enz.
